&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Incubate and Elevate Partnerships: Transform opportunistic relationships into established, growing, and strategic global partnerships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Executive Alignment: Build, foster, and facilitate executive sponsorships and relationships to ensure close collaboration and support across key business stakeholders globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enablement and Joint GTM: Onboard, enable, and build joint sales plays and offerings with strategic SI partners. Define clear strategic partner alignment to support sales, increase wallet-share in accounts by origination, and secure new customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
