&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Global Navigation: Demonstrated ability to successfully navigate, execute, and build relationships in a cross-market global capacity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strategic Growth: Proven experience in building, growing, and executing strategic SI relationships and transforming opportunistic connections into strategic partnerships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
