&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight on your impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re not looking for average. &amp;nbsp;Do you enjoy diving into issues and designing complex solutions?&amp;nbsp; Do you have a passion for data, multi-dimensional modeling and data integration? If so, this job is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Anaplan Consultant, you are primarily responsible for architect, design and the successful delivery of Anaplan financial planning solutions in strategic accounts. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand, review and gather client requirements per Anaplan defined scoping &amp;amp; analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate existing solutions, spreadsheets, and business problems into sophisticated Anaplan multi-dimensional models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modify existing models as part of a connected solution, optimization, or to incorporate new functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the architectural SME for large-scale connected planning solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exemplify The Anaplan Way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide candid, meaningful feedback and progress updates in a timely manner to the Project Manager/Business Partner and team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Anaplan model documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and/or lead Data Integration and Migration Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and/or lead UAT testing and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your qualifications, your influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To be successful in the role, you must possess the following skills&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in Finance, Accounting or Supply chain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years experience in Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis space - Good to have experience in any EPM tool like Anaplan, SAP BPC, Oracle EPM, etc.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject matter expertise in planning and modeling in financial planning and analysis is required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sophisticated Microsoft Excel / financial modeling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer/client facing experience in Indonesia market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven knowledge of a formal system implementation methodology – requirements gathering, design, build/test and deploy (Agile methodology preferable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superb written and oral communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record to lead execute responsibilities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appetite for service excellence and a collaborative style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for business analytics, modeling and planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem solving and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented, motivated, self-starter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collegial, open and grounded in integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to work with a truly dynamic and exciting team, with a “roll-up your sleeves” approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong desire to excel and be committed to gaining exposure to multiple industries while further developing your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that you will be expected to learn and grow in using Anaplan product in a technology consulting and Customer facing capacity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
