&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Proven track record of building, managing, and scaling technology or platform delivery teams (ideally 20+ members) in an offshore/nearshore model.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Extensive experience in line management, performance evaluation, and team motivation.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
