&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Sufficient exposure to the Anaplan platform to thoroughly understand the context, challenges, terminology, and best practices of model building and architecture.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
