&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management skills, with a proven ability to build trust and bridge geographical and cultural gaps with UK and US-based leadership teams.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
