&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li9&quot;&gt;Track record of building trust rapidly in new environments&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
