&lt;li&gt;Experience with deep learning for sequential data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Transformer-based approaches for time series.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in causal inference or causal machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PyTorch or TensorFlow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Spark / PySpark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms like AWS or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MLOps and automated model lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
