&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;883&quot;&gt;FinOps &amp;amp; Budget Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;912&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Establish FinOps frameworks to track, allocate, and forecast AI infrastructure spend, managing high-cost GPU/CPU cloud budgets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Resource Efficiency &amp;amp; Unit Economics:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Implement auto-scaling, spot instances, and down-scaling policies to eliminate waste, while providing full visibility into the unit economics of training and serving LLM models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
