&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;In this new role we are seeking a native or bilingual fluency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2019&quot;&gt;in Polish &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2038&quot;&gt;- alongside fluent English.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;773&quot;&gt;When you connect with target accounts, you’ll deliver a game-changing message:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;855&quot;&gt;there is a better, easier way to do business planning, forecasting, and modelling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;937&quot;&gt; You will use strategic Account-Based Marketing techniques to build rapport, nurture relationships, and set the stage for our direct enterprise sales force. Exciting, right?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1143&quot;&gt;Drive Global Growth:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1165&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Generate exciting sales opportunities by rapidly following up on inbound leads and launching targeted outbound prospecting (calls, emails, social) into our key markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
