&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;117&quot;&gt;As part of the ADO team under GPTO Engineering, you’ll report to the Sr. Director of Engineering. This team is accountable for Performance test automation, configuration, and verification delivering repeatable performance comparison testing and diagnosis across a range of ADO operations at enterprise scale, enabling high-performance AI-driven workloads, and acting as a technical bridge between engineering and architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
