&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1068&quot;&gt;Drive fast-paced, continuous delivery practices—leading the transformation from monthly to daily release cycles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1183&quot;&gt;Balance process rigor with delivery velocity; know when documentation adds value and when it creates friction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
