&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and enhance CI/CD platforms and deployment workflows using tools such as Jenkins, Kargo, ArgoCD, and GitHub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain Infrastructure as Code using Terraform and Terraform Enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Kubernetes-based platform operations including Helm-based deployments and container lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and improve developer enablement tooling and internal platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to self-service platform initiatives that improve engineering productivity and reduce operational overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain observability solutions using Grafana, Loki, Prometheus, OpenTelemetry, and related tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to troubleshoot build, deployment, networking, and runtime issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate operational tasks using scripting and programming languages such as Python, Kotlin, or Bash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cloud infrastructure across AWS, Azure, and GCP environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in platform reliability, incident response, root cause analysis, and continuous improvement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain technical documentation, operational runbooks, and platform standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
